{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Client in Computing"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about The Client in Computing."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe common activities at work to a using short sentences in familiar spoken and written situations.  Make the result report from the analysis of the information system, based on the customer requirements, following established rules and protocols."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Participates in simple conversations or simulated situations about the communicative topics for this level through the appropriate use of simple pronunciation aspects, and grammar and vocabulary structures. Recognizes simple ideas on requirement reports, tools for Object Oriented Programming, and other basic progamming tools."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Present Continuous for Plans and Be Going To for Intentions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We can use <span class=\"strong\">present continuous</span> and <span class=\"strong\">be going to in question</span> to talk about plans we have for the future or to express our intentions. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going to ask Karl to design a wiki"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm talking about client in computing in our next meeting, so I read some articles about the subject"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">PRESENT CONTINUOUS</span> </div>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can use the <span class=\"strong\">present continuous</span> to talk about plans we have for the near future. When using this tense, we are certain that we are going to carry the action out. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Form</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Structure</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb to be in simple present + main verb in \u2013ing form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>We <span class=\\\"strong\\\">are working</span> with new clients next month. </i>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb to be in simple present + not + main verb in \u2013ing form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>We<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> are not working</span> with new clients next month.</i>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interrogative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb to be in simple present</span> + subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">main verb in \u2013ing form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Are</span> we <span class=\\\"strong\\\">working</span> with new clients next month?</i>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interrogative With Question Word</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Wh word + verb to be in simple present</span> + subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">main verb in \u2013ing form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Why are</span> we <span class=\\\"strong\\\">working</span> with new clients next month?</i>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Notice that when we use present continuous to talk about plans, we need to add a <span class=\"strong\"> time expression. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div class=\"center_text\"><span class=\"strong\">BE GOING TO</span></div>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can use the <span class=\"strong\">present continuous</span> to talk about plans we have for the near future. When using this tense, we are certain that we are going to carry the action out. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Form</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Structure</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb to be in simple present + going to + main verb in its base form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <i>You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">are going to talk</span> to the manager before next week. </i>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb to be in simple present + not + going to + main verb in its base form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <i>You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">are not going to talk</span> to the manager before next week.</i>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interrogative</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb to be in simple present </span>+ subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">going to + main verb in its base form </span>+ complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <i><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Are</span> you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">going to talk </span> to the manager before next week?</i>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Interrogative With Question Word</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Wh word + verb to be in simple present</span> + subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">going to + main verb in its base form</span> + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <i><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Where are</span> you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">going </span>to talk to the manager?</i>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Computer Network Diagrams"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A computer network diagram is used in computer, telecommunication to draw a graphical chart of a network"}, {"type": "text", "content": "A computer network diagram consists of a network that is made up of interconnected groups or systems. A network diagram is a visual representation of network architecture. It maps out the structure of a network with a variety of different symbols and line connections. It is the ideal way to share the layout of a network because the visual presentation makes it easier for users to understand how items are connected. <br/><br/>  There are different computer network systems. Observe the chart below:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Basic Network Diagram</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is used to create simple network designs and network architecture diagrams. It Uses basic network and computer equipment shapes.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">3D Network Diagram</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It helps create the 3D perspective network.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Detail Network Diagram</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is used to create detailed physical, logical and network architecture diagrams. It uses a comprehensive set of network and computer equipment shapes.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Logical Network Diagram</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is the way in which signals act on the network media or, in which data passes through the network from one device to another without considering the physical interconnection of devices.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rely"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to depend on something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fat clients perform the bulk of any data processing operations by themselves, and they don't rely on a server. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bulk"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to something or someone that is very large"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fat clients perform the bulk of any data processing operations by themselves, and they don't rely on a server. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "retrive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to keep information "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They should process information locally, but rely on the server for storing certain data. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "centralized"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "controlled by one main system or authority"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The primary function of a client-server system is to create a division of labor between a centralized server and the individual computers that are running your software. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "host computer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a controlling computer that provide data to other devices that are connected to it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have thin clients, which use the resources of the host computer and normally present only processed data that they receive from an application server. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about clients in co